/AGENTS.md

# Generated build/runtime state is never distribution source.
**/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Saved/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/.vs/
**/*.pdb
**/*.obj

